  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      201.45,
      350.41,
      402.32,
      361.48
    ],
    "text": "OF THE KATTANKUDY URBAN COUNCIL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      186.33,
      363.37,
      417.43,
      387.4
    ],
    "text": "UNDER SECTION 65A(2) OF THELOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      137.61,
      389.29,
      465.91,
      413.32
    ],
    "text": "(CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BYLOCAL AUTHORITIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No. 30 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      428.17,
      493.11,
      439.24
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of a member in Kattankudy Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      454.33,
      547.85,
      504.28
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Group Leader of the Independent Group No. 1 to which the former Member Abdul LeththeefMuhammathu Sabeel, belonged was required by me under Section 65A(2) of the aforesaid Ordinance, to nominate within aperiod of thirty (30) days a person eligible under the Ordinance for Election as a member of that Kattankudy Urban Council whoshall be declared elected as a member ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      519.37,
      547.81,
      543.4
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Leader of the aforesaid group has nominated Mr. Muhammathu Abulhasan MuhammathuMihlar being an eligible person under the aforesaid Ordinance to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      558.25,
      547.83,
      608.44
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Abdul Majeedu Mahammadu Kabeer, Returning Officer of Kattankudy Urban Council, actingin terms of Section 65A(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance as amended by filling of vacancies in Local Authorities(Special Provisions) Act, No. 30 of 2013 (Chapter 262) do hereby declare Mr. Muhammathu Abulhasan Muhammathu Mihlarelected as a member of the Kattanduky Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      622.33,
      536.5,
      698.44
    ],
    "text": "A. M. M. KABEER,Returning Officer,Kattankudy Urban Council.District Elections Office,Batticaloa,23rd January, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
